Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Question 1
1.\tOver the region  -15 cm < x < 15 cm and -15 cm < y < 15 cm, construct the \
following representations of the electric potential for the charge \
arrangement shown in the plot below:
a)\t3-d equipotential surface (use ListCountourPlot3D)
b)\t2-d contour map (use ListCountourPlot)
c)\t3-d elevation graph (use ListPlot3D)
Question 2
2\ta) Using the same arrangement as in Problem 1, make a plot of the \
electrical potential energy for a proton along the x-axis from -15 cm to +15 \
cm.
      b) If the proton starts from rest at the origin, what will be its speed \
at x = 15.0  
           cm? 
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8921653119952703`*^9, 3.892165333915289*^9}, {
  4.000464929069063*^9, 
